# Lazy evaluation: unused bindings in fn bodies are never forced.
# The raise in '_' (wildcard) never fires because it is never accessed.
# Using _ for the binding name suppresses the lost-binding lint — it is the
# conventional placeholder for a value computed but intentionally not used.
[test: [fn [let x] [_: [raise "dead binding"]] [+ x 1]]]
[test 41]
=== out
Int(42)
